{"form": "<form id=\"contact-form\" novalidate> <div class=\"form-progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuemin=\"1\" aria-valuemax=\"2\" aria-valuenow=\"1\" aria-label=\"Request progress\"> <span class=\"form-progress-dot is-active\" data-dot=\"1\"></span> <span class=\"form-progress-dot\" data-dot=\"2\"></span> </div> <p class=\"form-step-count\">Step <span id=\"form-step-current\">1</span> of 2</p> <div class=\"form-step is-active\" data-step=\"1\"> <span class=\"form-step-eyebrow\">Who is asking</span> <div class=\"field\"> <label for=\"nombre\">Full name</label> <input type=\"text\" id=\"nombre\" name=\"nombre\" placeholder=\"Your name\" autocomplete=\"name\" required> </div> <div class=\"field\"> <label for=\"empresa\">Company</label> <input type=\"text\" id=\"empresa\" name=\"empresa\" placeholder=\"Your company's name\" autocomplete=\"organization\" required> </div> <div class=\"field\"> <label for=\"email\">Email</label> <input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@company.com\" autocomplete=\"email\" inputmode=\"email\" required> </div>  <details class=\"form-extra\"><summary>Add a phone number or anything else (optional)</summary> <div class=\"field\"> <label for=\"telefono\">Phone <span class=\"field-optional\">(optional)</span></label> <input type=\"tel\" id=\"telefono\" name=\"telefono\" placeholder=\"+34 600 000 000\" autocomplete=\"tel\" inputmode=\"tel\"> </div> <div class=\"field\"> <label for=\"mensaje\">Which processes would you like to automate? <span class=\"field-optional\">(optional)</span></label> <textarea id=\"mensaje\" name=\"mensaje\" placeholder=\"Give us a quick idea of what you'd like help with...\" autocomplete=\"off\"></textarea> </div> </details> </div> <div class=\"form-step\" data-step=\"2\"> <span class=\"form-step-eyebrow\">Last step</span> <div class=\"form-compliance\"> <div class=\"consent-field\"> <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"acepta-privacidad\" name=\"aceptaPrivacidad\" required> <label for=\"acepta-privacidad\">I have read and accept the <a href=\"/en/privacidad\">Privacy Policy</a>.</label> </div> <div class=\"security-check\"> <span class=\"security-check-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> <span class=\"security-check-copy\"> <span class=\"security-check-label\">Security check</span> <div class=\"cf-turnstile\" data-sitekey=\"0x4AAAAAAD0dueh5OBC9Zdkm\" data-theme=\"auto\" data-size=\"flexible\" data-expired-callback=\"dcodeTurnstileExpired\" data-error-callback=\"dcodeTurnstileError\"></div> </span> </div> </div> <p class=\"form-note\" id=\"form-note\">Once you submit it, we will email you within 24h to schedule the 30-minute call.</p> </div> <div class=\"form-nav\"> <button type=\"button\" class=\"boton form-nav-back\" id=\"form-back-btn\">Back</button> <button type=\"button\" class=\"boton boton--principal form-nav-next\" id=\"form-next-btn\">Continue</button> <button type=\"submit\" class=\"boton boton--principal form-nav-submit\" id=\"form-submit-btn\"> Request the diagnosis </button> </div> </form> <div class=\"form-success\" id=\"form-success\" hidden> <span class=\"form-success-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> <h2>Request sent successfully</h2> <p>We've received your request. Our team will review it and get back to you within 24h to tell you what we would build and where we would start.</p> </div>", "rows": [["Email", "<a href=\"mailto:dcodedepartment@gmail.com\">dcodedepartment@gmail.com</a>"], ["Phone — Diego", "<a href=\"tel:+34680223439\">680 22 34 39</a>"], ["Phone — Dimitry", "<a href=\"tel:+34614547570\">614 54 75 70</a>"], ["Location", "Madrid, Spain"], ["Availability", "We respond within 24h"]], "meta": {"title": "Contact — Book a Meeting with D-Code Partners", "desc": "Tell us how your company works today. In a 30-minute meeting we will tell you what we would build and where we would start."}, "hero": ["Book your meeting", "Let’s start with a diagnosis.", "Tell us where your business stands today. In a 30-minute meeting we will tell you what we would build, with what scope, and where we would start."], "faq": ["Have questions before reaching out?", "/en/faq", "See frequently asked questions"], "ld": ["\n{ \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [ { \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://dcodepartners.com/en\" }, { \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Contact\", \"item\": \"https://dcodepartners.com/en/contacto\" } ]\n}\n"]}